{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1b72a4d026ce0ce80d19d89a28cffc7bdf9ec9bcbd6a52fca48016e50739d95f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"ai4finance-foundation/finrobot@6d6ccd32c1b8 snapshot 41e01cd34f0a44ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13229ec05391ec459e1ac2d3cc8605005d9d5a68f1267b7d80bd9fcbfb2baab8","slc_31e754fd490f5ba090bbb282fd52973ff172ea8263da2798bbde4e802d0f6148","slc_a23a235b4bb89c07f38e5d254e36f76d9a06fb40caab5db8d807b1b961ff816d"],"source_ids":["src_c05da2e14faf5e7097c1bff3bafe4364"],"text":"A stated core principle is strict separation of deterministic financial computation from LLM narration: valuation numbers (DCF, DDM, LBO, WACC, comps, Monte Carlo) come from pure-Python code paths, while the LLM handles reasoning and report writing, with provenance tracking.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_36ce7f34f5dc2ccd950d5d0e9ee69f10e66fbd4d330bb171043a576634e07d39","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"ai4finance-foundation/finrobot@6d6ccd32c1b8 snapshot 41e01cd34f0a44ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c7a683a2de76663ab3d87b98223ef5d3a47d9335bfa81d2ac34ee7e6d95880ec","slc_c7ff081bbe8b25cb02a93e183b837f93912313d1dce51158c6f303c6f4ac3ea0","slc_e927fc3e448fc917d695bb492889f66ac1f0e1407e1dac49d05df65c4e759537"],"source_ids":["src_c05da2e14faf5e7097c1bff3bafe4364"],"text":"The desktop product's multi-agent architecture uses one Lead Agent orchestrating five role-based sub-agents (data, analysis, modeling, synthesis, reporting) plus three debate agents (bull, bear, judge) in a pipeline flow.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5e5c9911d1db9d0ea5b66361f035ee1f7370a4f096981dd8f849b0bf2d18b8e4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"ai4finance-foundation/finrobot@6d6ccd32c1b8 snapshot 41e01cd34f0a44ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_61ea3b0ad7109f3c38dd9c2a9364896420f656d159882e1326f9b9ba0e0e8af5"],"source_ids":["src_c05da2e14faf5e7097c1bff3bafe4364"],"text":"The codebase snapshot lists 9 agents, 7 research pipelines (company research, DCF, comps, LBO, DDM, earnings, IC memo), 30 pure-Python compute operators with 7 coordinators, and 7 data providers with failover including FMP, Finnhub, yfinance, and SEC EDGAR.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5f6d17bd470abb1cb40ad92ef567440f381e4a30d7f7a5656d2eb10ec10da925","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"ai4finance-foundation/finrobot@6d6ccd32c1b8 snapshot 41e01cd34f0a44ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_059a28b0442949c8685870727d6dcffd6151cdb316efb0fca130fc96e6eb4f53","slc_ce07088eaf8dc967d709e5e8ca9cee6f9600d1318b81b763411f85119812aab7"],"source_ids":["src_c05da2e14faf5e7097c1bff3bafe4364"],"text":"The project deliberately avoids tying itself to one agent framework; each generation adopts new agent architectures while keeping the financial domain layer, tools, and deterministic computation at the core.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_874b4bfc3d4d8709f5db802555ac1fae55199e8a7b9bec3516d42360bc39bbcc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"ai4finance-foundation/finrobot@6d6ccd32c1b8 snapshot 41e01cd34f0a44ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7f48d2627e6f3b4666232f7b9ac922f7fbb1225f6464a16b6244e3f6c9110b73","slc_7fa177ff18d317bbefff717f6ad979e41b2120c287775213b7ac1d04c4622c79","slc_f90ecc738241bf38741bab3ccc362565d4bd07f476cd77fdf47a5f39f436ac2e"],"source_ids":["src_c05da2e14faf5e7097c1bff3bafe4364"],"text":"FinRobot Desktop v0.1.0 supports only Apple Silicon Macs (M1-M3 or later) with no Intel builds, and the app is not yet Apple-notarized, so users must clear the quarantine attribute via xattr before first launch.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_af52e26dded544f1e9344a8e63340e87eb06697a39b31e3a9c11e0b5f863b558","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"ai4finance-foundation/finrobot@6d6ccd32c1b8 snapshot 41e01cd34f0a44ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_43ec0f5db63fce5ac863b1505294a6c90b59e267c4b938fe20f04d34c08676dc","slc_52a79f5c86d82fa70aeeb9955e487e02fb74615b652a7a1ef420bc736a46d765","slc_c83c6539c6be641f1394e0b4142c24b1220af7e0d347be66129134f02e417f88"],"source_ids":["src_c05da2e14faf5e7097c1bff3bafe4364"],"text":"The finrobot_equity CLI exposes scripts such as generate_financial_analysis.py and create_equity_report.py taking flags like --company-ticker, --peer-tickers, and --analysis-csv, and a web app accessible at http://127.0.0.1:8001.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d937a316be820bfa268a9922d46f964857cdc41018e450df7a36cbe1981385e3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"ai4finance-foundation/finrobot@6d6ccd32c1b8 snapshot 41e01cd34f0a44ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_71d4741e594f61f2710e1d55432ee53978b620eda79dfa3464fac36af9715d32","slc_945dfd25f1ab4ef5924370b3fffc90fe0fd42c7892e25e51ca9dce2c90eca1b7"],"source_ids":["src_c05da2e14faf5e7097c1bff3bafe4364"],"text":"The repository hosts V0 (AutoGen-based FinRobot) and V1 (finrobot_equity, equity-research agents and report generation) as open source; V2 is online-only with source not yet open-sourced, and V3 is in development.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dfd3d700facb847df55d031de518534d764fc9e08928c73fb8ea4759d941020c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"ai4finance-foundation/finrobot@6d6ccd32c1b8 snapshot 41e01cd34f0a44ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7cfc896ce19f2b96ce3596973bddd65cc116b850e40a7eae1ce789e5bd9368c7"],"source_ids":["src_c05da2e14faf5e7097c1bff3bafe4364"],"text":"FinRobot is described as an AI agent platform for financial applications that unifies LLMs, reinforcement learning, and quantitative analytics for investment research, trading strategies, and risk assessment.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f3a8808dfbccf47f484fffc3fca49e060595647ff1cd29c6d848cc92af9a7ba3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"ai4finance-foundation/finrobot@6d6ccd32c1b8 snapshot 41e01cd34f0a44ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_840344428bad3619834779eae84a44035803b291071942712bf412a536226315","slc_b0e3680cd6c06feeb648de25037390a1a967e44911a3334a764a4aa8f431e0ab"],"source_ids":["src_c05da2e14faf5e7097c1bff3bafe4364"],"text":"The legacy finrobot package is organized into agents (agent_library.py, workflow.py), data_source (finnhub, finnlp, fmp, sec, yfinance utils), and functional modules (analyzer, charting, coding, quantitative, reportlab, text), with beginner and advanced tutorial notebooks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f5c74921209acfcf7e8451eb875046977c993b6e9d6f5e354629238e22caa099","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"ai4finance-foundation/finrobot@6d6ccd32c1b8 snapshot 41e01cd34f0a44ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4a4e017b98cffb8ea79b165d3348416d89632a08f8e4af8466786b5e2ae1172d","slc_8beb12e7e75452c0cdd5e9b5a5e1bcf656fc2faa3a0c1e2d3e76c2aa19c76bed","slc_b02f386a2851c44676efdcffd554989c84bc1fbd951ed810a7b1fa0ad78d119d","slc_c83c6539c6be641f1394e0b4142c24b1220af7e0d347be66129134f02e417f88"],"source_ids":["src_c05da2e14faf5e7097c1bff3bafe4364"],"text":"Setup involves copying config.ini.example and OAI_CONFIG_LIST_sample / config_api_keys_sample templates and adding OpenAI, Finnhub, FMP, and SEC API keys; deployment is via deploy.sh start/stop/restart/status or a manual venv plus run_web_app.py.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9b48d9cf65874e348981096b3aeb9729"}
